<<widget 'robin-temple-purification-summons'>>
  <<set $templetest to 'failed'>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.monthly_checked to true>>
  <<run maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').startPunishment(_args[0])>>
  <<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "You must be purified, as one. I will summon the specialists. Please cooperate with them." Jordan produces a small bell from <<his>> robes and rings it.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “作为一体，你们必须被净化。我会召集专人来，请一定要配合。”约旦从斗篷里拿出一个小铃铛，摇了摇。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if _args[0]>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin and Sydney quickly cling to your arms.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        悉尼和罗宾飞速地用手挽住了你的两条胳膊。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin quickly clings to your arm.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾飞速地用手挽住了你的胳膊。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<robin-temple-punishment-exit>>
<</widget>>

